              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eri nikiro na wandu wiserumiriagha wiko Judea, na wokoni wudumiki ghwapo andenyi ya Jerusalemu ghurumirikie kwa waeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
